SET enable_seqscan = off;
EXPLAIN (costs off) SELECT count(*) FROM pg_class;
                                QUERY PLAN                                 
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
 Aggregate
   ->  Index Only Scan using pg_class_tblspc_relfilenode_index on pg_class
 Optimizer: Postgres-based planner
